    "text": "If the area of the region $\\left\\{(\\mathrm{x}, \\mathrm{y}): 1+\\mathrm{x}^2 \\leq \\mathrm{y} \\leq \\min \\{\\mathrm{x}+7,11-3 \\mathrm{x}\\}\\right\\}$ is A , then 3 A is equal to",
