  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/PYV_cwUoHEyN8m1xerfnLMKiPYkVMOhkh3i_OKwo0x8.original.fullsize.png\"/><br/>$\\begin{aligned} & A=\\int_{-2}^1\\left(x+7-x^2-1\\right) d x+\\int_1^2\\left(11+3 x-x^2-1\\right) d x \\\\ & =\\left[\\frac{x^2}{2}+6 x-\\frac{x^3}{3}\\right]_{-2}^1+\\left[10 x-\\frac{3 x^2}{2}-\\frac{x^3}{3}\\right]_1^2 \\\\ & =\\frac{50}{3} \\Rightarrow 3 A=50 \\quad \\text { Option (1) }\\end{aligned}$",
